                <customfields>
                                                <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;ins&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;b&gt;NEW CRITERIA (UAT&#160;Required):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/ins&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC1_R3.0.0 &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&#160;:&lt;/b&gt;&#160;User&#160;shall&#160;be&#160;able to&#160;manually&#160;generate&#160;an ad hoc audit trail for&#160;any&#160;experiment&#160;that&#160;has one of the&#160;following&#160;statuses: Active, In&#160;Review, or&#160;Closed.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC2_R3.0.0 &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; Users shall be informed once the experiment audit trail reports generation is initiated.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC3_R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&#160; System shall automaticaly generate audit trail report after an experiment has been sent for review by a user.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC4_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;Users&#160;shall&#160;be&#160;able to&#160;search&#160;for and download&#160;experiment&#160;audit trail reports&#160;through&#160;a web user interface.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC5_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;Users&#160;shall&#160;be&#160;able to download audit trail reports in&#160;both&#160;PDF and Excel (.xlsx) formats.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC6_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;The PDF audit trail report&#160;shall&#160;include&#160;the&#160;following&#160;sections:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Header&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;History&#160;table&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Footer&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC7_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;The Excel audit trail report&#160;shall&#160;include&#160;the&#160;following&#160;sections:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Metadata&#160;rows&#160;(at top)&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;History&#160;entries table&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC8_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;The PDF audit trail header&#160;shall&#160;display:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Experiment&#160;name&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Experiment&#160;description&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Experiment&#160;closing&#160;date (or &quot;Experiment&#160;Ongoing&quot; if not&#160;closed)&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC9_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;The PDF audit trail&#160;history&#160;table&#160;shall&#160;contain&#160;the&#160;following&#160;columns:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&quot;Date/Time&quot; (data and time+ TMZ (DD-MMM-YYYY hh:mm:ss (24h format) UTC+ x amount of offset time))&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&quot;User Name&quot; (eg. full name like Tamara Van den Broeck)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;User ID&quot; (eg. JnJ mail)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Resource Type&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Entity Name&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;&quot;Action&quot; (eg. create, edit, delete,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Change Type&quot; (eg. Worksheet Changes, Row Modified, Row Added, ...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Details&quot; (eg. when no new value is available, copy worksheet, delete table,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Old Value&quot; (eg. lists the previous value)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;New Value&quot; (eg. lists the current value)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Event ID&quot; (Signals event ID)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC10_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;The PDF audit trail&#160;footer&#160;shall&#160;display:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Page&#160;number&#160;(page of total pages)&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Date and time&#160;including&#160;timezone&#160;of PDF&#160;generation&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC11_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;The Excel audit trail&#160;metadata&#160;rows&#160;shall&#160;display:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Experiment&#160;name&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Experiment&#160;description&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Experiment&#160;closing&#160;date (or &quot;Experiment&#160;Ongoing&quot; if not&#160;closed)&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Date and time&#160;including&#160;timezone&#160;of&#160;excel&#160;generation&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC12_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;The Excel audit trail&#160;history&#160;table&#160;shall&#160;contain&#160;the&#160;following&#160;columns:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&quot;Date/Time&quot; (data and time+ TMZ (DD-MMM-YYYY hh:mm:ss (24h format) UTC+ x amount of offset time))&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&quot;User Name&quot; (eg. full name like Tamara Van den Broeck)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;User ID&quot; (eg. JnJ mail)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Resource Type&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Entity Name&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;&quot;Action&quot; (eg. create, edit, delete,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Change Type&quot; (eg. Worksheet Changes, Row Modified, Row Added, ...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Details&quot; (eg. when no new value is available, copy worksheet, delete table,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Old Value&quot; (eg. lists the previous value)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;New Value&quot; (eg. lists the current value)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Event ID&quot; (Signals event ID)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC13_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;PDF audit trail files&#160;shall&#160;follow&#160;this&#160;naming&#160;convention:&#160;&lt;b&gt;ExperimentName_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;ExportDateTimeTimezone.pdf&lt;/b&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC14_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;Excel audit trail files&#160;shall&#160;follow&#160;this&#160;naming&#160;convention:&#160;&lt;b&gt;ExperimentName_ExportDateTimeTimezone.xlsx&lt;/b&gt;&#160;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC15_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;Users&#160;shall&#160;receive&#160;a notification&#160;when&#160;a&#160;searched&#160;experiment&#160;audit trail report&#160;does&#160;not&#160;exist.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC16_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0&lt;/b&gt; ** &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;{&lt;/b&gt;}&#160;Users shall have access to the complete experiment history containing all modifications across all sections through the audit trail report.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC17_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** *&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; :{*}&#160;Users shall have access to a dedicated web user interface for System Audit Trail report.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC18_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; Users shall be able to request for report generation for a dedicated period of time. &#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC19_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; Users shall be able to download system audit trail reports.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC20_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; Users shall be able to select a monthly period of time for report generation with the following format : &#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Month : Dropdown with full name format&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Year : Dropdown with &apos;yyyy&apos; format&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC21_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; Users shall be able to select a monthly period of time to download &#160;generated reports with the following format : &#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Month : Dropdown with full name format&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Year : Dropdown with &apos;yyyy&apos; format&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC22_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; Users shall be awarned when a report generation process has been initiated.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC23_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; Users shall be awarned when a report has not been yet requested or generated. &#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC24_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; Users shall be able to download the generated System Audit Trail report as an Excel (.xlsx) file.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC25_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The downloaded Excel file shall contain one dedicated sheet per resource type category, covering: &#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Notebook&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;Attributes&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;ADO&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;External Action&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;Data Source&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;System Group&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;Materials Definition&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;Roles&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;SO Properties&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;Security Policy&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Templates&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;System Settings&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;Global Numbering.&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC26_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; Each sheet shall display the applicable filter metadata in the top rows, including :&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;Resource Type(s)&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;From date&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;To date&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Actions&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Additional filters&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC27_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The From date shall be set to the first day of the selected month, and the To date shall be set to the last day of the selected month, or to the current date if the month is not yet complete.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC28_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; Each sheet shall display the audit log data in an Excel table format with the following columns: &#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Date and time&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;User Name&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;User ID&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;Ressource Type&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;Entity Name&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Action&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;Changes Type&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;Details&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Old Value&#160; (when available)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;New Value&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Event ID.&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC29_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;The Date and time column shall display values in the following format: DD-MMM-YYYY hh:mm:ss (24h format) with UTC offset (e.g., UTC+2).&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC30_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The downloaded Excel filename shall follow the naming convention: SAT-MMM-YYYY_&amp;lt;&amp;lt;export timestamp DD-MMM-YYYY hh-mm-ss (24h format) UTC+x offset&amp;gt;&amp;gt;.xlsx.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC31_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The Notebook sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Type Notebook filtered on Actions Moved/Transferred and Deleted/Trashed, with the following additional filters:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For Notebook: Department = Synthetics Development-GxP&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For GxP Experiment: entity type = GxP Experiment&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC32_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The Attributes sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Type SNConfig: Attribute filtered on Actions Edited and Deleted/Trashed, with the following additional filters:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Name = Variant Name in Variations Table&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Name contains &quot;GxP&quot;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC33_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The ADO sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Types SNConfig: Admin Defined Object Definition and SNConfig: System Admin Defined Object Template, filtered on Action Edited, with the following filters applied per Resource Type:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For SNConfig: System Admin Defined Object Template: Name = GxP-GMP General Template&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For SNConfig: Admin Defined Object Definition: Additional filter on Updated workflow for &quot;GxP Request&quot; workflow and Updated workflow for &quot;GxP Experiment&quot; workflow&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC34_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The External Action sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Type SNConfig: External Action filtered on Actions Edited and Deleted/Trashed, with the following additional filter:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Name contains &quot;GxP&quot;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC35_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The Data Source sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Types SNConfig: External Data Source and SNConfig: Internal Data Source, filtered on Actions Edited and Deleted/Trashed, with the following additional filter applied to both Resource Types:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Name contains &quot;GxP&quot;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC36_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The System Group sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Types SNConfig: Group Associations and SNConfig: System Groups, filtered on Actions Created, Edited and Deleted/Trashed, with the following filters applied per Resource Type:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For SNConfig: Group Associations: System group name contains &quot;GxP&quot;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For SNConfig: System Groups: User ID is different from service account&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC37_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;The Materials Definition sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Types SNConfig: Materials Definition and Container Type, filtered on Actions Edited and Deleted/Trashed, with the following filters applied per Resource Type:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For SNConfig: Materials Definition: Material Name contains &quot;GxP&quot;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For Container Type: Container type name contains &quot;GxP&quot;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC38_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The Roles sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Type SNConfig: Roles, filtered on Actions Edited and Deleted/Trashed, with the following Name filters:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Standard User&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Janssen Internal User&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;GxP Std User&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;GxP Superuser&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC39_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The SO Properties sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Type SNConfig: Sample/Task properties, filtered on Actions Created, Edited and Deleted/Trashed.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC40_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;The Security Policy sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Type SNConfig: Security Policy, filtered on Action Edited.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC41_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt;The Templates sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Types SNConfig: Worksheet Template, SNConfig: System Sample Template, SNConfig: Table Template and SNConfig: System Experiment Template, filtered on Actions Edited and Deleted/Trashed, with the following additional filter applied to all Resource Types:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Name contains &quot;GxP&quot;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC42_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The System Settings sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Types System Settings, System Settings: Timeout and full audit log (no resource type), filtered on Action Edited, with the following filters applied per Resource Type:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For System Settings: Deletion, Workflow settings, AI feature&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For System Settings: Timeout: Session Timeout&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For no resource type: Enabled users to edit first and last name, Disabled users to edit first and last name&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC43_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The Global Numbering sheet shall extract audit log entries for Resource Type System Settings: Global Numbering, filtered on Action Edited, with the following additional filters:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Notebook&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;GxP Request&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;GxP Experiment&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Sample&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;AC44_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;R3.0.0 ** &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;NEW&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;GXP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;/b&gt; The downloaded Excel filename shall follow the naming convention: SAT-MMM-YYYY_&amp;lt;&amp;lt;export timestamp DD-MMM-YYYY hh-mm-ss (24h format) UTC+x offset&amp;gt;&amp;gt;.xlsx.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</customfieldvalue>

